Initiative, MIT License; the full text is in verso/ru/church_calendar/data/LICENSE.svyatcy.
The names base (verso/ru/naming/data/base/) takes its canonical names from that table.

The names base also takes given names and their «said to be the same as» links from Wikidata
(https://www.wikidata.org), whose data is CC0 — no attribution is required; it is given as a
courtesy. Its other rows are the maintainer's own: the spellings the metric books write, paired
with their bases (a name and its base — no record is carried), and the forms written as grammar.
The sources of each row: verso/ru/naming/data/base/SOURCES.md.

